(6674745, 998402, 49018, '<td valign="top">Tones<br/> <br/>    Basic, Lighter, Muted (4 fingers on tip clap zils together)<br/>    Rim (tapping clicking)<br/>    Clap, Vibrating  hands in v shape, touching zils, one hand still vibrate the other, nice for spinning.<br/> <br/>Basic Patterns<br/> <br/>    Singles (one strike on each beat)<br/>    Doubles 12 12 12<br/>    Triples 1-2-3-(pause), 1-2-3-(pause), 1-2-3-(pause)<br/>    Continuous 11111111<br/>    Beledi  DumDum Tek-aTek Dum Tek-a-Tek<br/> <br/>Thanks, it''s not every day that I find out about a new instrument, I might get two actually. 8</td>', 'Tones     Basic, Lighter, Muted (4 fingers on tip clap zils together)    Rim (tapping clicking)    Clap, Vibrating  hands in v shape, touching zils, one hand still vibrate the other, nice for spinning. Basic Patterns     Singles (one strike on each beat)    Doubles 12 12 12    Triples 1-2-3-(pause), 1-2-3-(pause), 1-2-3-(pause)    Continuous 11111111    Beledi  DumDum Tek-aTek Dum Tek-a-Tek Thanks, it''s not every day that I find out about a new instrument, I might get two actually. 8', '2012-02-13 18:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
