(6694832, 998658, 54645, '<td valign="top">Yes, there is movement in the image, which leads to the music in my mind. The lesson, if there needs to be one, is perspective. You manipulated peace and stillness of the image via the point of view and perspective. The resulting tension is what brings me back to the movement and music. Magical. Thank you for the lesson!</td>', 'Yes, there is movement in the image, which leads to the music in my mind. The lesson, if there needs to be one, is perspective. You manipulated peace and stillness of the image via the point of view and perspective. The resulting tension is what brings me back to the movement and music. Magical. Thank you for the lesson!', '2012-02-29 02:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
